<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Scottish cup and</p>
<p>league matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Scottish Cup third round replay</p>
<p> Aberdeen	     0    Hibernian	   0</p>
<p>(after extra time. Hibernian won 5-3 on penalties)</p>
<p> Greenock Morlton   4    Arbroath	    0</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> East Fife	    2    St Johnstone	2</p>
<p> St Mirren	    3    Dundee		2</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p> Ayr		    1    Hamilton	    0</p>
<p> Stenhousemuir	0    Clyde		 0</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Cowdenbeath	  1    Ross County	 1</p>
<p> Queen's Park	 0    Albion		0</p>
</text>
